{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36222","headline":"与乡人鉴休上人别 · 方干","name":"与乡人鉴休上人别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此日因师话乡里，故乡风土我偏谙。\n一枝竹叶如溪北，半树梅花似岭南。\n山夜猎徒多信犬，雨天村舍未催蚕。\n如今休作还家意，两须垂丝已不堪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36222.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36222","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}